<title>GERMANY: German DTB says technical problems delaying trade.</title>
<headline>German DTB says technical problems delaying trade.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Deutsche Terminboerse (DTB) futures and options exchange said on Friday the start of trade had been delayed by technical problems and trading was expected to start at around 0700 GMT.</p>
<p>The exchange trades German debt and stock futures and options including the Bund futures contract.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
